<section class="page-heading"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE ABOUT US</span><h1>Baking happiness,<br><em>one day at a time.</em></h1><p>A small local bakery with a big love for beautiful, feel-good food.</p></div></section><section class="container section story-grid about-story"><div class="story-photo"><img src="assets/photos/hero.jpg" alt="Fresh croissants and pistachio pastries"></div><div class="story-copy"><span class="eyebrow">ROOTED IN IRBID, JORDAN</span><h2>Good food brings <em>us together.</em></h2><p>Sukkar & Zaatar is a fictional local bakery created for the BIT481 university project. Its vision is inspired by the warm neighborhood shops of Jordan: a place where every fresh bake can brighten someone's day.</p><p>Our online platform helps a small bakery organize its menu, incoming orders, stock levels, and customer communication — all in one place.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="<?=h(url('shop'))?>">Explore the menu ↗</a></div></section><section class="value-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">OUR LITTLE VALUES</span><h2>Why we do <em>what we do.</em></h2></div></div><div class="values-grid"><article><span>✺</span><h3>Freshness first</h3><p>Every treat begins with a commitment to quality, freshness and flavor.</p></article><article><span>♡</span><h3>People matter</h3><p>We aim to make every visit and every order feel personal.</p></article><article><span>♧</span><h3>Locally inspired</h3><p>We celebrate Jordanian warmth with familiar favorites and modern details.</p></article></div></div></section>
